5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"We need to be realistic about our staffing. I'll look into administrator retirements and hiring times, and depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm worried about the actual gear and the timing! I'll check yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial, plus the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to see the long-term financial patterns. I'll examine the board minutes on capital and operating requests and five years of renewal invoices.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to make sure we have clear ownership and flexibility! I'll check support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent approach is to examine our technical debt. I shall look into the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
